# Aika Stream Play ship

When shipping `com.developerscoffee.tv.midas`, follow
`.agents/skills/shipping-aika-stream-play/SKILL.md` and
`docs/okf/aika-stream-play/playbooks/shipping-play-drop.md`.

## Invariants

- **Never reuse a Play `versionCode`**, including codes removed from a draft. As of 2026-09-28, 21–25 are spent; do not re-upload 25.
- **Do not bump** `app/pubspec_tv.yaml` past the live OBB unless this task is that next drop.
- **SSOT** is `app/pubspec_tv.yaml`. Sync the stub with `scripts/aika_stream_version.sh --sync-stub`. Pass `--build-name <name> --build-number <code>` (spaces, not `=`).
- **Production `release.keystore` only.** Kill a `build-tv.sh` run that would mint `tv-validation`.
- **Human uploads** the AAB. Agent publishes Internal, then Production. Live means Production Latest, not in-review.
- **Release branch** `release/aika-stream-v{versionName}` from the SHA that built that AAB, not later `main`.
- Do not merge leftover IPTV worktrees into the Play SHA. Play dart-defines stay unset. `[skip ci]` is docs-only.
